mode-names (standard rule 7): Mode names are lowercase words; a one-mode collection calls its mode default. 0 findings.

collection-names (standard rule 8): Collections are named for their category. 2 findings.
  [breaks the standard] These collection names are not in the category list (Color, Typography, Radius, Space, Gradient). The collection name becomes the JSON path and CSS prefix, so this decides every exported name. (4)
      collection Themes should be Color
      collection Density should be Space
      collection Surface Gradients should be Gradient
      primitive collection Colors should be Color
  [decide] The standard's category list (Color, Typography, Radius, Space, Gradient) has no place for these four (Border, Size, Motion, Elevation); extend the list or fold them into an existing category. (3)
      collection Border (4 variables)
      collection Size (10 variables)
      collection Motion (4 variables)

